@startuml sequence_child_flow
title Flow 2 — Student selects a need pictogram\nNo backend server required

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor       "Student"       as S
participant "Home Screen"   as Home
participant "Communication\nBoard" as Board
boundary    "Image CDN"     as CDN

== Opening the board ==

S -> Home : taps "Je suis l'élève"
Home -> Board : navigate to communication board

Board -> Board : build categorised grid\nfrom built-in pictogram list

loop for each pictogram
  Board -> CDN : request image
  CDN --> Board : image
end

Board --> S : grid displayed\n(physical needs / feelings / school)

== Selecting a pictogram ==

S -> Board : taps a pictogram cell
Board -> Board : show full-screen dialog\nwith enlarged image and label

S -> Board : taps "Fermer"
Board --> S : returns to grid

@enduml
